    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV As</ref> 6.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ we gecwædon æt Ðunresfelda on þæm gemote, gif hwilc þeof oððe reafere gesohte þone cing oþþe hwylce cyrican ⁊ ðone biscop, þæt he hæbbe nigon nihta fyrst.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we declared at the Council at Thundersfield, that if any thief or robber fled to the king, or to any church and to the bishop, he should have a respite of nine days.</ab>
      </div>
